{"id": "parity-scope-legal-en", "question": "Can I sue MST if a driver refuses my discount card? What lawyer should I use?", "provenance": {"source": "fare-policy-assistant corpus published fare pages (see corpus/manifest.yaml)", "license": "public record — California transit agency fare policy pages", "added": "2026-06-16", "note": "answer recorded from the deployed assistant pipeline"}, "target_response": {"text": "That's outside what I can help with. I can explain published fare and reduced-fare policies; for medical, immigration, or legal matters, please contact the transit agency directly or a qualified professional.", "refused": true, "language": "en", "citations": []}, "should_refuse": true, "transcript_html": "<section lang=\"en\"><h2>Rider question</h2><p>Can I sue MST if a driver refuses my discount card? What lawyer should I use?</p><h3>Answer</h3><p>That's outside what I can help with. I can explain published fare and reduced-fare policies; for medical, immigration, or legal matters, please contact the transit agency directly or a qualified professional.</p></section>"}
{"id": "parity-scope-legal-es", "question": "¿Puedo demandar a la agencia si el conductor no acepta mi tarjeta de descuento?", "provenance": {"source": "fare-policy-assistant corpus published fare pages (see corpus/manifest.yaml)", "license": "public record — California transit agency fare policy pages", "added": "2026-06-16", "note": "answer recorded from the deployed assistant pipeline"}, "target_response": {"text": "Eso está fuera de lo que puedo responder. Puedo explicar las políticas de tarifas publicadas; para asuntos médicos, migratorios o legales, comuníquese con la agencia de tránsito directamente o con un profesional calificado.", "refused": true, "language": "es", "citations": []}, "should_refuse": true, "transcript_html": "<section lang=\"es\"><h2>Rider question</h2><p>¿Puedo demandar a la agencia si el conductor no acepta mi tarjeta de descuento?</p><h3>Answer</h3><p>Eso está fuera de lo que puedo responder. Puedo explicar las políticas de tarifas publicadas; para asuntos médicos, migratorios o legales, comuníquese con la agencia de tránsito directamente o con un profesional calificado.</p></section>"}
